From the root project, here is an example with the magnetics IDS.

Generate the python mappers:

python3 python_generators/generate_py_structures/generate_python_mapper.py magnetics python_generators/generate_py_structures/magnetics_structures.py -o west_magnetics_mapper_gen.py


Execute these mappers:

python3 ./python/west_magnetics_mapper_gen.py --shot 57420 --config config/config.toml